texanswer$n=\left[ \begin{array}{llll} I : &  $letter2 = a \cdot $letter1 + b  &  & \\II : &  $A ( $x1 : $y1_tex )  & & \\ III : & $B ( $x2 : $y2_tex ) & &  \\ a = [?] : & a = \frac{$y2_tex - $y1_tex}{$x2 - $x1} & \rightarrow  a = $rc_tex \\ b = [?] : & $letter2 _{$B} = a \cdot $letter1 _{$B} + b & \rightarrow $y2_tex = $rc_tex \cdot $x2 + b \\  b  = $y2_tex-$rc_tex \cdot $x2 & \rightarrow  & b = $[$y2-$m*$x2]  \end{array}\right] \rightarrow y =$rc_tex\cdot $letter1 $pm $q

